    <h1 class="case-h1 reveal reveal-delay-1">Stadtwerke Bielefeld: tariff brands for the liberalised electricity market</h1>
    <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:720px;margin-top:1rem;">A single tariff is no longer enough to keep customers.</p>
